{"timestamp":"2026-09-04T16:39:33.211Z","ordinal":1365,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a06d4a-2e5b-71e1-815e-74333fd19dbe","call_id":"call_nBu83djSoY5DIBZkiCOV2i7R","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 0.1 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"\nShared parity buffer를 다시 쓰기 전에는 같은 parity의 이전 attention과\nD2H가 끝나야 한다. Event를 줄이거나 buffer 수를 바꿀 때는 writer,\nreader, alias와 reuse distance를 먼저 증명해야 한다.\n\n### 3.3 Feature gate 주의사항\n\n정확한 ON/OFF 정의와 실행 조합은\n[기능 조합 테스트](EXPERIMENT_GUIDE.md#1-feature-정의)를 따른다.\n\n- Weight offload에는 전역 `--no-offload-weight`가 없다.\n- `--no-offload-kv`는 weight 설정을 바꾸지 않는다.\n- KV compression은 KV offload 없이 사용할 수 없다.\n- `--reduce-kv-footprint`는 clean KV-offload OFF가 아니라 별도 allocator\n  실험이다.\n- `--weight-comp`만 추가해도 raw YAML cell이 자동으로 압축되지는 않는다.\n\n## 4. Sibling patch와 native ABI\n\nPatch 파일은 runtime에 읽히지 않는다. Sibling source에 적용되고 native\nextension이 빌드되어 있어야 한다. 현재 workspace와 저장된 patch의\n일치 여부는 reverse-check한다.\n\n```bash\ngit -C /root/projects/vllm \\\n  apply --reverse --check /root/projects/tiered-serve/patches/vllm.patch\n\ngit -C /root/projects/vllm-flash-attn \\\n  apply --reverse --check \\\n  /root/projects/tiered-serve/patches/vllm-flash-attn.patch\n\ngit -C /root/projects/pytorch \\\n  apply --reverse --check /root/projects/tiered-serve/patches/pytorch.patch\n```\n\nClean base에 적용할 때는 `git apply --check` 후 `git apply`한다. Sibling\n코드를 수정하면 같은 변경에서 대응 patch도 갱신한다. Tiered flag를\n꺼도 patched vLLM은 clean upstream과 동일한 baseline이 아니다.\n\nWriter/reader symbol smoke:\n\n```bash\ncd /root/projects/tiered-serve\n\n./.venv/bin/python - <<'PY'\nimport torch\nfrom vllm import _custom_ops as ops\nfrom vllm.vllm_flash_attn import flash_attn_varlen_func_buffer\n\nassert callable(ops.reshape_and_cache_flash_buffer)\nassert hasattr(torch.ops._C_cache_ops, \"reshape_and_cache_flash_buffer\")\n[patch header]\ndiff --git a/cmake/external_projects/vllm_flash_attn.cmake b/cmake/external_projects/vllm_flash_attn.cmake\nindex ff687e0af..09275f88a 100644\n--- a/cmake/external_projects/vllm_flash_attn.cmake\n+++ b/cmake/external_projects/vllm_flash_attn.cmake\n@@ -24,26 +24,21 @@ endif()\n # This is to enable local development of vllm-flash-attn within vLLM.\n # It can be set as an environment variable or passed as a cmake argument.\n # The environment variable takes precedence.\n-if (DEFINED ENV{VLLM_FLASH_ATTN_SRC_DIR})\n-  set(VLLM_FLASH_ATTN_SRC_DIR $ENV{VLLM_FLASH_ATTN_SRC_DIR})\n+# Always use the patched ../vllm-flash-attn sibling. The tiered-serve buffer\n+# ABI is not available in the upstream source, so falling back to an automatic\n+# vanilla clone would build successfully and then fail at Python import time.\n+get_filename_component(VLLM_FLASH_ATTN_SRC_DIR \"${CMAKE_SOURCE_DIR}/../vllm-flash-attn\" ABSOLUTE)\n+if(NOT EXISTS \"${VLLM_FLASH_ATTN_SRC_DIR}/CMakeLists.txt\")\n+  message(FATAL_ERROR\n+    \"Patched vllm-flash-attn sibling not found at ${VLLM_FLASH_ATTN_SRC_DIR}\")\n endif()\n+message(STATUS \"Using vllm-flash-attn: ${VLLM_FLASH_ATTN_SRC_DIR}\")\n \n-if(VLLM_FLASH_ATTN_SRC_DIR)\n-  FetchContent_Declare(\n-          vllm-flash-attn SOURCE_DIR \n-          ${VLLM_FLASH_ATTN_SRC_DIR}\n-          BINARY_DIR ${CMAKE_BINARY_DIR}/vllm-flash-attn\n-  )\n-else()\n-  FetchContent_Declare(\n-          vllm-flash-attn\n-          GIT_REPOSITORY https://github.com/vllm-project/flash-attention.git\n-          GIT_TAG 86f8f157cf82aa2342743752b97788922dd7de43\n-          GIT_PROGRESS TRUE\n-          # Don't share the vllm-flash-attn build between build types\n-          BINARY_DIR ${CMAKE_BINARY_DIR}/vllm-flash-attn\n-  )\n-endif()\n+FetchContent_Declare(\n+        vllm-flash-attn SOURCE_DIR\n+        ${VLLM_FLASH_ATTN_SRC_DIR}\n+        BINARY_DIR ${CMAKE_BINARY_DIR}/vllm-flash-attn\n+)\n \n \n # Ensure the vllm/vllm_flash_attn directory exists before installation\ndiff --git a/csrc/cache.h b/csrc/cache.h\nindex cbe44c09e..703f3f602 